  "prefLabel": "Plc 2005.07 Obtaining a Certification After Expiration, Lapse, Suspension, or Revocation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 2005.07 Obtaining a Certification After Expiration, Lapse, Suspension, or Revocation.\n\n(a) The procedures in Plc 312 shall govern how to obtain a certification after expiration, suspension, or revocation.\n\n(b) To obtain certification after the prior certification has lapsed, the former certificant shall apply for a new certification in accordance with Plc 2003.04.\n\nSource. #14217, INTERIM, eff 4-1-25; ss by #14388, eff 10-24-25, EXPIRES: 10-24-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc2000.html"
